  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening South Africa&#x2019;s Asset Recovery Capability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to increase the capability of South Africa&#x2019;s Asset Forfeiture Unit (AFU) to undertake complex, multi-jurisdictional investigations through on-the-job mentoring and case based assistance on some of South Africa&#x2019;s highest profile and most consequential cases. These include cases stemming from the Zondo Commission on state capture.</narrative>
  </description>
